  "added": "2026-10-23",
  "notes": "Recalls the Elta Music Solar 42N, a drone and ambient machine. Two banks of five detuned saws drone on D from the start; FX and LFO switch them on and off, EDIT the noise voice (white noise opened in stepped bursts by a sample & hold). The keys play a saw with a sub an octave down, and PLAY runs a 5-step line through the same voice. Everything goes through a drive stage, two band-pass filters swept together by one slow LFO, a long reverb and a ping-pong delay. Pages: Keys, Drones (tuning, micro-tuning, spread, level per bank), Noise, Filters (bands, sweep and drive, mix), Space."
